Advanced Mobile Application with AI & Real-Time Chat

A feature-rich cross-platform mobile application developed as part of my 6th-semester Computer Science coursework. This project demonstrates core concepts of real-time cloud integration, AI APIs, and responsive mobile architecture.
 Key Features
- Firebase Authentication: Secure user signup, login, and Forget Password functionality.
- Real-Time Chat: Live peer-to-peer user chatting using Firebase Realtime Database.
- AI Chatbot Integration: Built-in AI assistant for smart automated conversations.
- QR Code Scanner: Embedded scanner for instant QR code processing.
- Push Notifications: Instant system alerts and notifications for user updates.
- Monetization Setup: Integrated test ads to demonstrate mobile ad placement.
- Modular UI: Structured using Android Fragments for smooth, responsive user navigation and interface clean design.

 Tech Stack & Architecture
- Backend/Database: Firebase Authentication & Firebase Realtime Database
- UI Architecture: Android Fragments & Custom Layouts

Technical Concepts Applied
- Asynchronous Data Handling
- API & Third-Party SDK Integration (AI Chatbot & QR Scanner)
- State & Real-Time Data Management
